  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞花\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成為贊助者\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞花》是《Friends&amp;Foes》模組的一個小型擴充套件，為每種花朵新增了一種哞花變體。哞花可以發現於草甸與花叢森林生物群系中。您可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>以取得更多關於哞花的資訊。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">🐮 哞花變體</span></p>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蔥屬植物</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">天藍翠雀花</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" alt=\"蔥屬植物哞花\" width=\"133\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" alt=\"天藍翠雀花哞花\" width=\"146\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">藍色蘭花</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">矢車菊</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" alt=\"藍色蘭花哞花\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" alt=\"矢車菊哞花\" width=\"139\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蒲公英</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">丁香花</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" alt=\"蒲公英哞花\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" alt=\"丁香花哞花\" width=\"144\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">鈴蘭</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">橘色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" alt=\"鈴蘭哞花\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" alt=\"橘色鬱金香哞花\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">洋甘菊</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">牡丹</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" alt=\"洋甘菊哞花\" width=\"134\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" alt=\"牡丹哞花\" width=\"150\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">粉紅鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">虞美人</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" alt=\"粉紅鬱金香哞花\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" alt=\"虞美人哞花\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">紅色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">玫瑰叢</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" alt=\"紅色鬱金香哞花\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" alt=\"玫瑰叢哞花\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">向日葵</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">白色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" alt=\"向日葵哞花\" width=\"150\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" alt=\"白色鬱金香哞花\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他擴充套件 / 數據包</span></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎<a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a>進行聊天、分享您的創作、提問，或單純獲取模組最新開發動態及新版本發布通知。此外，也歡迎透過<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues 回報任何當機或錯誤問題</a>。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支援</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無論是否有支援，我都將繼續開發我的模組，因為這是我的興趣，儘管我大多數的空閒時間都投入在模組開發上。因此，如果您仍想支持我，可以透過<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>進行贊助。在此同時，我非常感謝大家的所有支持。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>授權條款。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎參考我的程式碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何實現並解決各種問題，您也可以將相關程式碼片段融入自己的專案中。此外，您也可以在任意模組整合包中使用此模組（雖然若能註明出處或連結回此頁面將不勝感激）。</span></p>",
